{
  "id": "centrifugal_pumps___speed_torque_curve",
  "title": "Centrifugal Pumps - Speed Torque Curve",
  "description": "The characteristic speed torque curves for centrifugal pumps. Calculate theoretical torque based on pump speed or full load torque based on power and speed.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Speed Torque Curve\n\nThe speed torque curve characterizes a centrifugal pump. The theoretical characteristic is a parabola starting from the origin and proportional to the square of the speed.\n\n**Formula (1): Theoretical Torque**\n\nT = k × n²\n\nWhere:\n- T = torque (Nm)\n- k = constant\n- n = pump speed (rpm)\n\nWith the discharge valve closed, the torque amounts to 30-50% of the nominal torque at full speed.\n\n**Formula (2): Full Load Torque**\n\nT = 30 × P / (π × n)\n\nWhere:\n- T = torque (kN m)\n- P = power (kW)\n- n = pump speed (rpm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Calculation Method"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "method",
          "label": "Select Calculation Method",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "theoretical",
              "label": "Theoretical Torque (T = k × n²)"
            },
            {
              "value": "full_load",
              "label": "Full Load Torque (T = 30 × P / π × n)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Theoretical Torque Calculation"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "constant_k",
          "label": "Constant (k)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "speed_n_theoretical",
          "label": "Pump Speed (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "rpm",
          "defaultValue": 1500
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "torque_theoretical",
          "label": "Theoretical Torque",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "formula": "inputs.constant_k * Math.pow(inputs.speed_n_theoretical, 2)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Full Load Torque Calculation"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "power_p",
          "label": "Power (P)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "speed_n_full_load",
          "label": "Pump Speed (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "rpm",
          "defaultValue": 1500
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "torque_full_load",
          "label": "Full Load Torque",
          "unit": "kN m",
          "formula": "(30 * inputs.power_p) / (Math.PI * inputs.speed_n_full_load)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}